OL,4,CPontins fined #1m after grandmother's  
OL,5,Cdeath                                  
OL,6,GPontins holiday park resort has been   
OL,7,Gfined #1m after a grandmother died in  
OL,8,Ga "catastrophic incident" that was "an 
OL,9,Gaccident waiting to happen", a judge   
OL,10,Gruled.                                 
OL,12,FWendy Jones, 68, of Hereford, died six 
OL,13,Fmonths after a 40m (131ft) section of  
OL,14,Fair conditioning duct and ceiling      
OL,15,Fcollapsed onto guests at Pontins'      
OL,16,FBrean Sands resort, Somerset, in       
OL,17,FFebruary 2019.                         
OL,19,FOn Friday, Pontins' parent firm,       
OL,20,FBritannia Jinky Jersey, was sentenced  
OL,21,Fat Bristol Crown Court to pay a #1m    
OL,22,Ffine.                                  
